sequenceDiagram
    participant Trainer
    participant ReactApp
    participant CertAPI
    participant Database
    participant Member

    Trainer->>ReactApp: Mark enrollment completed
    ReactApp->>CertAPI: POST /api/certificates/issue
    CertAPI->>Database: Verify enrollment completed
    CertAPI->>Database: Insert UserCertificate
    CertAPI->>Database: Update UserLearningProgress
    CertAPI->>Database: Create notification
    CertAPI-->>ReactApp: 201 Certificate issued
    Member->>ReactApp: Open Badges page
    ReactApp->>CertAPI: GET /api/certificates/my
    CertAPI-->>ReactApp: Certificate list
    ReactApp-->>Member: Display certificate preview
